  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 304.01 Collection of Tolls",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 304.01 Collection of Tolls. All motor fuel and special fuel shall be assessed for tolls in accordance with the applicable laws and these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
